out.push("\n\n例如：\n\n```javascript\nconst response = await fetch(\n  `${Shopify.routes.root}cart/add.js`,\n  {\n    method: 'POST',\n\n    headers: {\n      'Content-Type': 'application/json'\n    },\n\n    body: JSON.stringify({\n      items: [\n        {\n          id: variantId,\n          quantity: 1\n        }\n      ],\n\n      sections: [\n        'cart-drawer',\n        'cart-icon-bubble'\n      ],\n\n      sections_url: window.location.pathname\n    })\n  }\n);\n\nconst data = await response.json();\n```\n\n返回的数据结构可以简化理解为：\n\n```javascript\n{\n  items: [\n    {\n      id: 123456789,\n      quantity: 1\n      // ...\n    }\n  ],\n\n  sections: {\n    \"cart-drawer\": \"<div>...</div>\",\n    \"cart-icon-bubble\": \"<div>...</div>\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nShopify 支持在 Cart API 请求中同时获取最多五个 Section 的渲染结果。如果某个 Section 渲染失败，对应值可能为 null，而购物车操作本身仍然可能已经成功。");
