out.push("\n\n这意味着需要将两个结果分开处理：\n\n- 商品是否成功加入购物车。\n- 加购之后，购物车 UI 是否成功更新。\n\n不能因为 Cart Drawer 渲染失败，就直接重新执行一次加购。\n\n---\n\n## 5. 实战：无障碍 AJAX 加购\n\n### 5.1 HTML 与 Liquid\n\n```liquid\n{% form 'product', product, id: 'AccessibleProductForm' %}\n\n  <input\n    type=\"hidden\"\n    name=\"id\"\n    value=\"{{ variant.id }}\"\n  >\n\n  <label for=\"ProductQuantity\">Quantity</label>\n\n  <input\n    id=\"ProductQuantity\"\n    name=\"quantity\"\n    type=\"number\"\n    min=\"1\"\n    value=\"1\"\n    required\n  >\n\n  <button\n    type=\"submit\"\n    data-add-button\n    {% unless variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}\n  >\n    Add to cart\n  </button>\n\n  <p data-cart-status role=\"status\"></p>\n\n  <p data-cart-error role=\"alert\"></p>\n\n{% endform %}\n```\n\n这里的两个 Live Region 提前存在于 DOM 中，并分别承担普通状态通知和错误通知。\n\n### 5.2 JavaScript\n\n以下示例采用加购成功后保留用户焦点、不自动打开 Drawer 的策略。\n\n```javascript\nconst form = document.querySelector(\n  '#AccessibleProductForm'\n);\n\nconst button = form.querySelector('[data-add-button]');\nconst status = form.querySelector('[data-cart-status]');\nconst error = form.querySelector('[data-cart-error]');\n\nlet submitting = false;\nlet needsRefresh = false;\n\nform.addEventListener('submit', async event => {\n  event.preventDefault();\n\n  if (submitting || needsRefresh || button.disabled) {\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const body = new FormData(form);\n\n  if (!body.get('id')) {\n    error.textContent = 'Please select an available product.';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  submitting = true;\n\n  button.setAttribute('aria-disabled', 'true');\n  button.classList.add('is-loading');\n\n  error.textContent = '';\n  status.textContent = 'Adding item to your cart.';\n\n  body.set(\n    'sections',\n    'cart-drawer,cart-icon-bubble'\n  );\n\n  body.set('sections_url', location.pathname);\n\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(\n      `${Shopify.routes.root}cart/add.js`,\n      {\n        method: 'POST',\n        body\n      }\n    );\n\n    const data = await response.json();\n\n    if (!response.ok || data.status) {\n      throw new Error(\n        data.description ||\n        data.message ||\n        'Unable to add item.'\n      );\n    }\n\n    status.textContent = 'Item added to your cart.';\n\n    // 单独处理 UI 渲染失败\n    try {\n      renderCartSections(data.sections);\n    } catch {\n      needsRefresh = true;\n\n      error.textContent =\n        'Item added, but the cart display could not be updated. Please view your cart.';\n    }\n\n  } catch (err) {\n    // 加购请求异常时不能假定购物车未变化\n    needsRefresh = true;\n\n    status.textContent = '';\n\n    error.textContent =\n      `${err.message} Please check your cart before trying again.`;\n\n  } finally {\n    submitting = false;\n\n    button.classList.remove('is-loading');\n\n    if (!needsRefresh) {\n      button.removeAttribute('aria-disabled');\n    }\n  }\n});\n```\n\n其中 `renderCartSections()` 需要根据你的 Theme 中实际存在的 Section 和 DOM 结构实现。\n\n生产环境中，应进一步提供重新读取购物车、刷新 Section 和恢复提交能力的入口。上面的教学代码采用了保守策略：出现不确定结果时暂时锁定加购，直到用户检查购物车。\n\n### 5.3 交互实验\n\n");
